+### Storage Usage
+
+`Account#bytes_used` and `Board#bytes_used` count card images and files embedded in board descriptions, card descriptions, and comments:
+- Attachments insert `Storage::Entry` deltas for their board as they're added and removed (append-only, so busy accounts don't contend on a counter row)
+- `Storage::MaterializeJob` folds entries into `Storage::Total`s for the board and its account; `bytes_used` reads the total
+- Destroying or moving a card records one entry for all its attachments; destroying a board or account releases its total in one go (`Storage.untracked`)
+- Anything that bypasses Active Record callbacks (bulk inserts, `delete_all`) isn't tracked. Imports and the weekly `Storage::ReconcileJob` recount in batches. Models in `app/models/storage/`
+
